eNum\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"02\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeName\",\"children\":\"Initial access\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeBody\",\"children\":\"External infrastructure, credential stuffing against exposure, phishing and pretexting where authorised, and the supply chain path.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Social engineering\",{\"className\":\"dg-scopeCell\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"03\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeName\",\"children\":\"Social engineering\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeBody\",\"children\":\"Phishing, vishing and physical pretexting under strict rules of engagement, with staff treated as colleagues rather than as targets to embarrass.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Assumed breach\",{\"className\":\"dg-scopeCell\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"04\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeName\",\"children\":\"Assumed breach\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeBody\",\"children\":\"Start from a foothold to test detection depth rather than spending the budget proving perimeter entry is possible.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Purple-team debrief\",{\"className\":\"dg-scopeCell\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"05\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeName\",\"children\":\"Purple-team debrief\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeBody\",\"children\":\"Replay the whole attack path with your defenders, step by step, and build the detections live. This is where most of the value lands.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Tabletop exercise\",{\"className\":\"dg-scopeCell\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-scopeNum\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeName\",\"children\":\"Tabletop exercise\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-scopeBody\",\"children\":\"Run the executive decision-making scenario separately, because the technical path and the decision path fail in different ways.\"}]]}]]}]]}],null]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"className\":\"dg\",\"id\":\"engagement-shape\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-gantt\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 1000 252\",\"preserveAspectRatio\":\"xMidYMid meet\",\"role\":\"img\",\"aria-label\":\"Engagement shape for Red Teaming: 6 phases. Phase 1, Objectives and rules, Weeks 1–2, inside the engagement window. Phase 2, Reconnaissance, Weeks 2–3, inside the engagement window. Phase 3, Initial access, Weeks 3–5, inside the engagement window. Phase 4, Objective pursuit, Weeks 5–8, inside the engagement window. Phase 5, Debrief, Week 9, inside the engagement window. Phase 6, Retest detections, Week 12, inside the engagement window, producing the detection retest report.\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"text\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-axisUnit\",\"x\":0,\"y\":16,\"children\":\"weeks from kick-off\"}],[[\"$\",\"g\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"line\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-grid\",\"x1\":236,\"y1\":30,\"x2\":236,\"y2\":226}],[\"$\",\"text\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-tick\",\"x\":236,\"y\":24,\"textAnchor\":\"middle\",\"children\":0}]]}],[\"$\",\"g\",\"5\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"line\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-grid\",\"x1\":445.1666666666667,\"y1\":30,\"x2\":445.1666666666667,\"y2\":226}],[\"$\",\"text\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-tick\",\"x\":445.1666666666667,\"y\":24,\"textAnchor\":\"middle\",\"children\":5}]]}],[\"$\",\"g\",\"10\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"line\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-grid\",\"x1\":654.3333333333334,\"y1\":30,\"x2\":654.3333333333334,\"y2\":226}],[\"$\",\"text\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-tick\",\"x\":654.3333333333334,\"y\":24,\"textAnchor\":\"middle\",\"children\":10}]]}]],[[\"$\",\"line\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-zero\",\"x1\":236,\"y1\":30,\"x